<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:54:57 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>OpenAI 的后续投资（第三期）的执行</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/execution-of-follow-on-investment-third-tranche-in-openai</link><description>孙正义为这场人工智能赌注提供资金的方式几乎和赌注本身的规模一样有趣。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:54:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/execution-of-follow-on-investment-third-tranche-in-openai</guid></item><item><title>AutoBenchmark：基准创建和人类的角色</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/autobenchmark-benchmark-creation-the-role-of-humans</link><description>如果人工智能要自我改进，谁来编写测试？ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/autobenchmark-benchmark-creation-the-role-of-humans2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:39:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/autobenchmark-benchmark-creation-the-role-of-humans</guid></item><item><title>美国宇航局毅力号火星探测器在一处发现地下水、湖泊和热流体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasas-perseverance-mars-rover-finds-groundwater-lakes-and-hot-fluids-in-one-place</link><description>毅力号没有遇到预期的沉积物，而是遇到了火成岩。当岩浆在地下冷却或火山物质在地表凝固时，就会形成这些岩石。由于火成岩内部的矿物可以保存有关其形成时的条件的信息，因此它们可以提供异常详细的地质记录。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasas-perseverance-mars-rover-finds-groundwater-lakes-and-hot-fluids-in-one-place.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:24:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasas-perseverance-mars-rover-finds-groundwater-lakes-and-hot-fluids-in-one-place</guid></item><item><title>物理学家在室温下用光对悬浮的玻璃微粒进行量子纠缠</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-quantum-entangled-a-levitating-speck-of-glass-with-light-at-room-temperature</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:09:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/physicists-quantum-entangled-a-levitating-speck-of-glass-with-light-at-room-temperature</guid></item><item><title>肌肉衰老最大悖论之一背后隐藏的开关</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-hidden-switch-behind-one-of-the-biggest-paradoxes-in-aging-muscle</link><description>哥本哈根大学的研究人员解决了为什么尽管耐用的慢肌纤维比例增加，但衰老的肌肉却变弱的悖论。研究表明，这种纤维类型的转变是对与年龄相关的线粒体损伤的保护性反应，特别是由心磷脂（一种重要的线粒体脂质）下降引起的。这种消耗会引发活性氧（ROS）的产生增加，从而向蛋白质 ERRγ 发出信号，将快肌纤维重新编程为慢肌纤维，从而有效地牺牲肌肉力量来保护细胞。值得注意的是，临床前实验表明，部分恢复心磷脂水平可以逆转这种与年龄相关的肌肉组织损失，这凸显了减轻肌肉减少症和与年龄相关的肌肉衰退的有希望的治疗目标。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-hidden-switch-behind-one-of-the-biggest-paradoxes-in-aging-muscle2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:54:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-hidden-switch-behind-one-of-the-biggest-paradoxes-in-aging-muscle</guid></item><item><title>威廉·莱恩·克雷格的卡拉姆宇宙论论证的 5 个主要问题（壮举：詹姆斯·福多）</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/5-major-problems-with-william-lane-craigs-kalam-cosmological-argument-feat-james-fodor</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:39:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/5-major-problems-with-william-lane-craigs-kalam-cosmological-argument-feat-james-fodor</guid></item><item><title>黑暗中做梦。用于设计感知电路的失落原始之眼 (Mvt) 方法，包括 Python 模拟</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dreaming-in-the-dark-lost-primal-eye-mvt-approach-to-designing-sentient-circuits-including-python-simulation</link><description>中位视觉理论（MVT），或者说“失落的原始眼睛范式”，占据了一个有趣的空间：它将比较神经解剖学、爬行动物到哺乳动物边界的顶叶/松果体眼睛的进化萎缩以及吸热的出现联系起来。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dreaming-in-the-dark-lost-primal-eye-mvt-approach-to-designing-sentient-circuits-including-python-simulation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:24:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dreaming-in-the-dark-lost-primal-eye-mvt-approach-to-designing-sentient-circuits-including-python-simulation</guid></item><item><title>工业人工智能视觉层刚刚获得 1250 万美元，让盲人机器人变得有用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/industrial-ai-vision-layer-just-got-12-5m-to-make-blind-robots-useful</link><description>Inbolt 为其人工智能驱动的工业机器人 3D 视觉软件筹集了 1250 万美元（目前总资金为 3400 万美元）。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/industrial-ai-vision-layer-just-got-12-5m-to-make-blind-robots-useful.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 01:09:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/industrial-ai-vision-layer-just-got-12-5m-to-make-blind-robots-useful</guid></item><item><title>人工智能驱动的医疗设备必须在现实环境中进行测试</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ai-powered-medical-devices-must-be-tested-in-real-world-settings</link><description>@ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-powered-medical-devices-must-be-tested-in-real-world-settings.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:38:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ai-powered-medical-devices-must-be-tested-in-real-world-settings</guid></item><item><title>“针对个体突变可能永远无法治愈癌症”——将癌症视为一种量子疾病</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/targeting-individual-mutations-will-likely-never-cure-cancer-viewing-cancer-as-a-quantum-disease</link><description>卡利法诺博士提出癌症由有限数量的细胞状态组成，而不是仅仅关注突变。同时针对所有状态可能有助于防止耐药性并改变精准肿瘤学。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/targeting-individual-mutations-will-likely-never-cure-cancer-viewing-cancer-as-a-quantum-disease.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 17:23:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/targeting-individual-mutations-will-likely-never-cure-cancer-viewing-cancer-as-a-quantum-disease</guid></item></channel></rss>